uiify Framework
Copyright 2026 Anton Gunkin

This software is built through clean-room reimplementation. Its authors studied
publicly available source code from open-source React component libraries to
understand patterns and techniques, then independently implemented all code from
scratch. No source code was copied or directly derived from any third-party library.

