uiify/hooks (Phase 1) — additional sources studied for hook APIs/behavior
(clean-room; no code copied):
- @uidotdev/usehooks        (MIT) — https://github.com/uidotdev/usehooks
- use-debounce              (MIT) — https://github.com/xnimorz/use-debounce
- react-intersection-observer (MIT) — https://github.com/thebuilder/react-intersection-observer
