The full clean-room policy is kept in the development repository (docs/CONTRIBUTING-clean-room.md).

uiify/components (Phase 3) — components studied for API/a11y/render trade-offs
(clean-room; no code copied).

uiify/core (Phase 2) also follows public web standards from WHATWG and CSSWG for
dialog, popover, Web Animations, and CSS Anchor Positioning. Standards were used
as behavioral specifications; no third-party runtime implementation is bundled.

